Most array problems reward looking at every element **once** while remembering what you have already seen.

```python run
nums = [2, 7, 11, 15]
seen = {}
for i, x in enumerate(nums):
    seen[x] = i
print(seen)
```

:::callout{kind=complexity}
One pass with a hash map: O(n) time, O(n) extra space.
:::

